UNPACK THE SOURCE CODE OF LIBTIFF HERE.

Previously at 
ftp://ftp.remotesensing.org/pub/libtiff/tiff-4.0.X.tar.gz

Then rename directory "tiff-4.0.X" AS "tiff"


It can be found under:
https://download.osgeo.org/libtiff/

Take the version tiff-4.2.0.zip:
https://download.osgeo.org/libtiff/tiff-4.2.0.zip
Newer releases are not compatible.